it To Second Round Of Investment In BetMGM', 'text': 'SECOND ROUND OF INVESTMENT IN BETMGM.SECOND ROUND INVESTMENT INCREASES TOTAL AMOUNT TO $450 MILLION.PROVIDES ADDITIONAL SUPPORT FOR BETMGM TO BECOME A LEADING PLAYER IN US SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING MARKETS.ROAR DIGITAL ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS SHAREHOLDERS HAVE COMMITTED TO A SECOND ROUND OF INVESTMENT.'}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2020-07-08 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'BRIEF-Linkedin pauses responses to requests from Hong Kong law enforcement', 'text': 'Fixes typo in headline:LINKEDIN SAYS PAUSING RESPONSES TO REQUESTS FROM HONG KONG LAW ENFORCEMENT AS IT REVIEWS NEW NATIONAL SECURITY LAW.'}{'symbol': 'ROST', 'date': '2020-07-08 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ross Stores Inc - Amended Note Purchase Agreement Dated October 17, 2006', 'text': 'ROSS STORES INC - AMENDED NOTE PURCHASE AGREEMENT DATED OCTOBER 17, 2006.ROSS STORES INC - NPA AMENDMENT AMENDS CERTAIN OF FINANCIAL COVENANTS APPLICABLE TO SERIES B NOTES.ROSS STORES - AMENDMENT UPDATES MINIMUM LIQUIDITY REQUIREMENT FOR CO TO MAINTAIN UNRESTRICTED CASH & CASH EQUIVALENTS, PLUS BORROWING AVAILABILITY.'}{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2020-07-08 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'United Airlines Holdings Expects Consolidated Capacity For August 2020 To Be Down Approx 65% Y-O-Y', 'text': 'UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - DURING TOWN HALL, MEMBERS OF MANAGEMENT INDICATED CONSOLIDATED CAPACITY FOR JUNE 2020 WAS DOWN ABOUT 88% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.UNITED AIRLINES - CONSOLIDATED CAPACITY FOR AUGUST 2020 IS EXPECTED TO BE DOWN APPROXIMATELY 65% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.UNITED AIRLINES - PLANS TO CONTINUE TO PROACTIVELY EVALUATE AND CANCEL FLIGHTS ON A ROLLING 60-DAY BASIS UNTIL IT SEES SIGNS OF A RECOVERY IN DEMAND.UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - MEMBERS OF MANAGEMENT INDICATED JULY 2020 CONSOLIDATED CAPACITY IS EXPECTED TO BE DOWN ABOUT 75% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.UNITED AIRLINES - EXPECTS DEMAND TO REMAIN SUPPRESSED UNTIL A WIDELY ACCEPTED TREATMENT AND/OR VACCINE FOR COVID-19 IS AVAILABLE.UNITED AIRLINES - CONSOLIDATED CAPACITY THROUGH END OF 2020 IS EXPECTED TO BE GENERALLY CONSISTENT WITH AUGUST.UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - MEMBERS OF MANAGEMENT NOTED THAT COMPANY DOES NOT EXPECT RECOVERY FROM COVID-19 TO FOLLOW A LINEAR PATH.UNITED AIRLINES - POTENTIALLY IMPACTED FRONTLINE EMPLOYEES BASED IN CA, IL, NJ AND NY WILL GET WRITEN WARN NOTIFICATION IN EARLY TO MID-JULY.UNITED AIRLINES - ALL EMPLOYEES WILL BE NOTIFIED ABOUT THEIR POSITION BY EARLY AUGUST WITH CHANGES EFFECTIVE OCT 1.'}{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2020-07-08 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'United Airlines Executive Says During Employee Town Hall That Not Enough Workers Have Signed Up For Voluntary Departures So Far - Sources', 'text': 'UNITED AIRLINES EXECUTIVE SAYS DURING EMPLOYEE TOWN HALL THAT NOT ENOUGH WORKERS HAVE SIGNED UP FOR VOLUNTARY DEPARTURES SO FAR - SOURCES.UNITED WORKING WITH PILOTS UNION ON WAYS TO MITIGATE FURLOUGHS - SOURCES.UNITED EXECUTIVE SAYS NO STRAIGHT LINE TO RECOVERY; UNITED NETWORK SLIGHTLY MORE IMPACTED THAN OTHER DOMESTIC U.S. AIRLINES - SOURCES.UNITED SEES DOMESTIC LOAD FACTORS AROUND 50%, INTERNATIONAL 30% IN JULY VERSUS AROUND 80% NORMALLY - SOURCES.'}